// A motive response names whether the line was stored.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE kept ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG kept rank

IMPULSE kept 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "stored" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
